### Here's the Pitch, Executive Decision Maker...

Why Choose Orion? The Enterprise Jamstack Wiki That Outperforms — and Costs Far LessWhat truly sets Orion apart isn't just another wiki—it's our proprietary Orion Technology, a battle-tested, patent-pending approach that delivers unmatched efficiency.

This lets us run ultra-low operating costs while offering superior editorial controls, enterprise-grade security, and groundbreaking features no legacy wiki can match. We pass those massive savings directly to you. Expect only modest, transparent upcharges for the exact cloud resources you use—no bloated pricing tiers or hidden fees.

Orion is built for leaders who refuse to settle:

- **University leaders** — Eliminate campus plagiarism and empower secure, open-access collaboration with version-controlled document sharing, curation, and online publishing. Transform your academic knowledge management into a modern, auditable platform.

- **Government &amp; defense IT decision-makers** — Meet FedRAMP infrastructure, NIST 800-207 zero-trust requirements, and fine-grained access controls on your version-control repository — all with FIPS 140-3 compliant security and installable inside your corporate VPN.

- **Marketing executives** — Run a fast, global, innovative enterprise platform for corporate website assets. Use Orion as a powerful headless CMS — secure, performant, and fully decoupled from frontend delivery.

- **Technology companies &amp; website agencies** — Replace insecure commercial wikis, tame mountains of product documentation, client sites, and even binary downloads. Curate everything with confidence, speed, and ironclad version history.

- **High-availability architects &amp; principled engineers** — Escape the single points of failure baked into SQL-based LAMP stacks. Embrace true Jamstack scalability: concurrent builds, incremental updates, global POP coverage, and peak performance measured in seconds.

- **Any business tired of wiki economics** — Ditch expensive SaaS subscriptions, fragile free tools that drain staff time, and outdated systems that slow your team down. Orion gives you enterprise power at a fraction of the total cost of ownership (often under $6,000/year for full enterprise use).

Zero vendor lock-in — and we prove it.Your content lives in clean Markdown and standard Version Control workflows. No proprietary formats. No migration nightmares.

Want transparency? See for yourself:

Our entire build-system logic for this very website: fewer than 100 lines of code, complete with sophisticated, memoized dependency management that auto-generates multilingual sitemaps, directory indexes, and more.

View the source: [our viewvc source lib tree](https://vcs.sunstarsys.com/viewvc/public/cms-sites/www.sunstarsys.com/trunk/lib/), or its [<i class="fa fa-github fa-emoji" title="Github"></i> GitHub mirror](https://github.com/SunStarSys/www/tree/trunk/lib).

The underlying Static Site Generator: open-sourced on GitHub under Apache License 2.0 → <https://github.com/SunStarSys/Orion>.

This isn't marketing spin—it's verifiable, open engineering heritage dating back to F/OSS innovations pioneered in 2011. Ready to experience a wiki that actually saves time, money, and headaches? [Give us a call or drop us a note](/contact) today.

